Z||000005||Carrolles||07-12-99||12:00 PM||||FOCOA's parts are a bit high but they do spend a lot of money getting discontinued parts back into production.  They are a good source for info but are very busy and sometimes hard to reach.  I've met Phil and Fiero Doc and both are very nice and dedicated to prolonging the life of Fiero.<p>There is something to be gained from all of the Fiero forums and club newsletters.  All have their particular personalities, some good - some bad.  I take it all in and appreciate whatever I can learn.<p>So far I've really enjoyed this forum.  The Fiero List was notorious for Flame Wars so I quit reading it about a year and a half ago.<p>Have a great day and enjoy Fieros while they last.<p>Carroll
